# PSR-4b-api-deps-fixture-split — decision: retain on API

## Question (from sync deferred)

> Decide whether finance/booking fixture packages stay on the API install graph.

Admin web (I.8) **skips** `workspaceFinance.registryOnly` / `workspaceBooking.registryOnly`
when collecting product trunk deps. API historically includes **every** manifest
package. This wave decides whether to mirror web and drop fixtures from
`apps/api/package.json`.

## Evidence against deletion

| Consumer | Why fixtures are required |
| --- | --- |
| `workspace-finance-*-bindings.generated.ts` | dynamic `import("@app-tour/workspace-finance-ws*/host/finance")` |
| `workspace-booking-*-bindings.generated.ts` | static imports from `@app-tour/workspace-booking-ws2` |
| `workspace-tour-write-bindings.generated.ts` | finance-ws3…ws6 tour-write adapters |
| `workspace-plugin-registry.generated.ts` | loads booking-ws2 + finance-ws5 plugins |
| API unit/integration specs | multi-workspace isolation / onboarding / capability gates |

Removing fixture deps would break `pnpm` resolution for generated modules and
certification specs even if runtime traffic never hits those workspace types.

## Decision

**Retain** all `workspace.manifest.json` packages on `apps/api` dependencies
(exact-set sync unchanged). Classification is documented and smoke-ratcheted;
deletion is explicitly **out of policy**.

| Class | Count | Examples |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| Product trunk | 6 | acme, denali, guest-club, harbor, starter, urban |
| Finance `registryOnly` fixtures | 4 | finance-ws2, ws3, ws4, ws6 |
| Certification workspaces (not registryOnly) | 2 | booking-ws2, finance-ws5 |
| **API install set** | **12** | union (exact manifests) |

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Inventory consumers + registryOnly flags | Yes |
| Decision: retain fixtures on API | Yes |
| Codegen partition helpers + unit coverage | Yes |
| Dedicated fixture-split smoke | Yes |
| Delete fixture deps from `apps/api/package.json` | **No** (forbidden by decision) |
| Mark booking-ws2/finance-ws5 as registryOnly | **No** (would change cert semantics) |

## Ratchet

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-api-deps-fixture-split-smoke.mjs
node --test scripts/test/api-host-product-deps.spec.mjs
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-api-deps-smoke.mjs
```

## Explicit non-goals

- Shrinking API product-dep ceiling below manifest count
- Moving fixtures to `devDependencies` only (Node still needs resolve for generated imports under test+boot)
- PSR-5 data authority
